Description: Touch-first live soundboard and audio routing tool for Linux
 Caster Soundboard is a high-performance audio playback and virtual
 microphone routing application designed for podcasters, streamers,
 and live audio broadcasting.
 .
 Features include a touch-first QML interface, PipeWire/PulseAudio virtual
 microphone routing, real-time waveform sweeper, audio ducking,
 kernel-level Push-to-Talk (PTT), local Web Remote, and MCP AI integration.
